---
import ResourceLayout from "../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro";
const sections = [{"id": "using-the-service", "label": "Using the service"}, {"id": "image-processing", "label": "Image processing"}, {"id": "acceptable-use", "label": "Acceptable use"}, {"id": "credits-and-payments", "label": "Credits and payments"}, {"id": "availability-and-changes", "label": "Availability and changes"}, {"id": "contact", "label": "Contact"}];
---
<ResourceLayout title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using Growx Chitra through WhatsApp." summary="Your responsibilities when using Chitra, how image packs work, and what to check before sharing an image." sections={sections} policy>
<h2 id="using-the-service">Using the service</h2><p>Growx Chitra helps businesses prepare product images through WhatsApp. You must be permitted to share the images and brand assets you send, and you remain responsible for your products, claims, pricing and customer communications.</p>
    <h2 id="image-processing">Image processing</h2><p>We process submitted images to create a cleaner product presentation. Review each result before sharing it. Image processing can change appearance; do not rely on an edited image to establish a product’s exact condition, dimensions, materials or performance.</p>
    <h2 id="acceptable-use">Acceptable use</h2><p>Use the service for lawful product photography. Sexual or 18+ imagery, deepfakes, face swaps, morphed imagery and identity manipulation are not allowed. See our <a href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="credits-and-payments">Credits and payments</h2><p>Eligible new businesses receive five lifetime free images. Paid image packs and their image counts are presented on our <a href="/pricing">Pricing page</a>. Payment confirmation and credit assignment depend on the payment provider’s verification. Refund requests are handled under the <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="availability-and-changes">Availability and changes</h2><p>The service depends on WhatsApp and other providers and may be unavailable or changed. We may suspend access to protect people, businesses or the service, or where required by law.</p>
    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms? Visit <a href="/support">Support</a>.</p>
</ResourceLayout>
